tools/

# Internal notes. The maintainer's guide lives OUTSIDE this tree, in
# ComfyUI-Easy-Install/_notes/ — deliberately, so no git command can publish it.
# These patterns are the second line of defence for anything that lands here anyway.
# Only README.md and CHANGELOG.md are meant to be public markdown.
docs/internal/
notes/
_notes/
NOTES.md
MAINTAINING.md
